# Freehold OS Pro — Gaming & Windows-app compatibility
# Run Windows software and games without leaving Freehold.

# Wine: the Windows compatibility layer (32-bit support for classic
# .exe installers is added by the pro-edition hook via i386 multiarch)
wine
winetricks

# NOTE: steam-installer is installed by the 0600-pro-edition hook —
# it depends on i386 multiarch, which must be enabled first.

# Performance: CPU/GPU governor optimization while gaming + FPS overlay
gamemode
mangohud
